Maintainer: Algothix OS Maintainers <maintainers@algothix.local>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://algothix.com

Package: alx-link
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, openssh-client, tmux, mosh, syncthing, xclip, wireguard-tools
Description: Cross-device pairing and workspace sharing for Algothix OS (ALX) Lite
 Pairs two or more Algothix OS machines with a one-time PIN confirmation code,
 exchanging SSH keys, configuring Syncthing (~/ALX-Sync at idle I/O priority),
 generating Input Leap keyboard/mouse sharing configs, and providing file send,
 clipboard push, remote tmux execution, status reporting, and clean unpairing.
